# Aurora brand (product surfaces)

**SSOT:** `app/aurora-brand.css` (tokens) · `app/aurora-components.css` (chrome, buttons, cards)

## Surfaces

| Route / area | Import |
|--------------|--------|
| SOHA portal | `aurora-brand.css` + `aurora-components.css` in `app/soha/layout.tsx` |
| Standard enroll | `@import aurora-brand.css` in `standard-enroll.css` |
| LP v4 | Tokens inline in `landing-v4.css`; fonts via `lib/funnel-fonts.ts` |
| Plan Builder `/plan` | `@import aurora-brand.css` in `quiz-funnel.css`; `--qf-*` aliases `--aurora-*` |

## Palette (light-first)

- Page bg: `#F5F8FA` (`--aurora-white`)
- Paper: `#FFFFFF`
- Navy chrome: `#121A2B` (header/footer strips only — not hero CTA boxes)
- Celestial `#0057A8` · Aurora `#77C89A` · Glow `#B8F5D1` · Forest `#2F6E47`

## Typography

| Role | Font | Weight |
|------|------|--------|
| Display / H1 | Source Serif 4 | 600 max, no italic |
| Body | Hanken Grotesk | 400–600 (never 800 on product UI) |
| Labels | DM Mono | sentence case preferred |

Load via `lib/funnel-fonts.ts` (`hankenGrotesk`, `displaySerif`, `dmMono`).

## Components

Use shared classes — do not invent parallel token stacks:

- `.aurora-header` / `.aurora-footer` — slim navy chrome
- `.aurora-btn-primary` / `.aurora-btn-secondary` / `.aurora-btn-ghost`
- `.aurora-hover-card` — light card + aurora top-line on hover
- `.aurora-hover-row` — list row slide
- `.aurora-border-glow` — optional feature squares

**Banned on product UI:** dark navy plan/CTA cards above the fold (use light hover cards).

## Banned (enforced by `npm run aurora:brand-guard`)

- Cream `#F5ECD9`, `--danielle-cream`, `--sr-cream`
- Fonts: Fraunces, Cormorant Garamond, Space Grotesk
- Full-page dark mode on enroll / LP / portal (one diagnostic score inset OK)

## Out of scope (legacy until migrated)

- `/danielle/*`, `content/danielle/*`, `/admin/*`
- Sohail locked enroll (`components/personalized-enroll/*`)

## Before claiming done

1. `npm run aurora:brand-guard`
2. `npm run agent:verify`
3. Scan new strings against messaging guide (no em dashes, banned tutor-ad jargon)
